wiki.com/index.php?title=Item:Giantcrafted_Chain_Shirt&amp;action=edit#editform\"><span class=\"edit-link\" style=\"display: inherit;\" title=\"edit this page\">edit this page</span></a></span> and remove this template.\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Giantcrafted_Chain_Shirt\">Giantcrafted Chain Shirt</span></h2>\n<table style=\"clear: right; border: 1px solid #FFD700; padding: 4px; width: 100%; --bg-color-1:#DDBB00;--bg-color-1-dark:#635400;--bg-color-2:#FFFACD;--bg-color-2-dark:#433E14;\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#F0DC82\" width=\"15%\">Armor Type\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFFACD\" width=\"42.5%\">Chain Shirt\n</td>\n<th class=\"bg-color-2\" rowspan=\"15\" style=\"background:#FFFACD;\" width=\"42.5%\" align=\"center\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/page/File:Giantcrafted_Chain_Shirt_shown.jpg\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Giantcrafted_Chain_Shirt_shown.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"420\" height=\"575\" class=\"mw-file-element\" /></a></span>\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#F0DC82\">Feat Requirement\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFFACD\">Light Armor Proficiency\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#F0DC82\">Race Absolutely Excluded\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFFACD\"><a href=\"/page/Warforged\" title=\"Warforged\">Warforged</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color: #F0DC82;\">Minimum Level\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #FFFACD;\">10\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#F0DC82\">Binding\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFFACD\"><a href=\"/page/Bind\" title=\"Bind\">Bound to Character&#160;on Acquire</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#F0DC82\"><a href=\"/page/Armor_bonus\" title=\